# Trusted-zone liveness watchdog (rc-11): exit-based recovery
# (entrypoint wait -n, quadlet Restart=) cannot see a HANG — a wedged
# event loop listens forever. This timer probes /health and restarts
# the zone on sustained failure. mcp-owned deliberately: `lab` must not
# gain the ability to touch the trusted zone. Its probe ports come from
# ports.env (~mcp/.config/labloop/ports.env) — never hardcoded.
qga_push "$WORK/ports.env" /tmp/labloop-ports.env
